              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khona-ke uJosefa wayala ukuba izikhwama zabo zigcwalise ukolweni futhi babuyisele imali yomuntu ngamunye esikhwameni sakhe futhi babanike umphako wendlela; wenza njalo kubo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
