          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunye wabo wavula isikhwama sakhe ukuba aphe imbongolo yakhe endlini yezihambi, wabheka imali yakhe; ngoba bheka, lalisemlonyeni wesikhwama sakhe.",
