              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indoda, inkosi yezwe, yathi kithi: ‘Ngalokhu ngiyakwazi ukuthi ningabantu abaqotho; Shiyani omunye wabafowenu lapha kimi, niphathele indlala yezindlu zenu ukudla, nihambe;",
          "type": "text",
